DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       The ggeettyyxx macro places the current cursor position of the given  window
       in the two integer variables _y and _x.

       If  _w_i_n is a subwindow, the ggeettppaarryyxx macro places the beginning coordi‐
       nates of the subwindow relative to the parent window into  two  integer
       variables _y and _x.  Otherwise, --11 is placed into _y and _x.

       Like  ggeettyyxx,  the ggeettbbeeggyyxx and ggeettmmaaxxyyxx macros store the current begin‐
       ning coordinates and size of the specified window.

